        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PKWAR: Text-Based Battle Royale MUD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every war. Everyone starts equal. Only knowledge wins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to PKWAR - a PvP MUD where 15-minute matches deliver intense, skill-based combat. No grinding. No gear advantages. Just you, your wits, and other players fighting for supremacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT MAKES PKWAR DIFFERENT:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>True Competitive Equality</strong> - Every match starts fresh. No player has equipment advantages. Veterans win through map knowledge and tactics alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ <strong>15-Minute Matches</strong> - Quick, intense battles that fit your schedule. No 8-hour grinding sessions required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Battle Royale Meets MUD</strong> - Spawn with nothing, scavenge equipment, hunt other players. Last warrior standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ <strong>2100+ Room Battleground</strong> - Master the massive map to find the best loot spawns, ambush points, and puzzles. Knowledge is power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Multiple Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-for-all bloodbaths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic team warfare</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Best vs Rest&quot; enforcer hunts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROGRESSION &amp; FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Skill-Based Ranking</strong> - Rise from Private to Captain through victories alone 🏆 <strong>46 Steam Achievements</strong> - Including hidden challenges 💰 <strong>Match Rewards</strong> - Earn credits through performance 🧙 <strong>Become an Implementor</strong> - Top players at level 10 can shape the game world 🎲 <strong>Dynamic Elements</strong> - Random weapon spawns and shifting maze exits keep every match fresh</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PERFECT FOR:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive gamers seeking pure skill-based PvP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MUD veterans wanting fast-paced action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle royale fans ready for a text-based challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone tired of pay-to-win and grinding</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No graphics. No distractions. Just pure, tactical combat where your mind is your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join now via Steam client or connect directly: pkwar . org port 2222</strong></p>",
